{"title":"Reddit's Bodyweight Fitness Recommended Routine","author":"r/BodyweightFitness","tagline":"The Recommend Routine (RR) is the bodyweight training program made by r/BodyweightFitness community.","diff":["Beginner","Intermediate"],"equip":"At Home","free":true,"vars":[{"v":"Default","wd":[1,3,5],"weeks":[{"d":[{"t":"Click the exercise name to see demo video. Click ••• to switch progressions. There are 9 exercises. These exercises are to be done in pairs and triplets to save time. Pairing 2 exercises means doing a set of the first exercise, resting 90 seconds, then doing a set of the second exercise, resting 90 seconds, and repeating until you've done 3 sets of that pair. For the triplet, you do a set of the first exercise, rest 60 seconds, do a set of the second exercise, rest 60 seconds, do a set of the third exercise, rest 60 seconds, and repeating until you've done 3 sets of that triplet. Read the full program guide for more info.","ex":[["Yuri's Shoulder Band Warmup","5-10"],["Squat Sky Reaches","5-10"],["GMB Wrist Prep","10"],["Deadbugs","30s"],["Arch Hangs","10"],["Support Hold","30s"],["Easier Squat progression","10"],["Easier Hinge progression","10"],["Scapular Pulls (Pull-Up #1)","5-8|5-8|5-8"],["Assisted Squat (Squat #1)","5-8|5-8|5-8"],["Parallel Bar Support Hold (Dip #1)","60s|60s|60s"],["Romanian Deadlift (Hinge #1)","5-8|5-8|5-8"],["Vertical Rows (Rows #1)","5-8|5-8|5-8"],["Vertical Pushup (Push-up #1)","5-8|5-8|5-8"],["Plank (Anti-Extension #1)","30s|30s|30s"],["Banded Pallof Press (Anti-Rotation)","8-12|8-12|8-12"],["Reverse Hyperextension (Extension #1)","8-12|8-12|8-12"]]},{"t":"Click the exercise name to see demo video. Click ••• to switch progressions. There are 9 exercises. These exercises are to be done in pairs and triplets to save time. Pairing 2 exercises means doing a set of the first exercise, resting 90 seconds, then doing a set of the second exercise, resting 90 seconds, and repeating until you've done 3 sets of that pair. For the